                                                                                
*  FUNKTION   :  LISTA UT, KONTROLL AV EN BESTÄLLD KATALOGS STATUS              
*                PÅ H-GRP, U-GRP OCH AVSN, M.A.P. RUBRIKER OCH                  
*                ILLUSTRATIONER.                                                
*                                                                               
*  FÖRFATTARE :  CONNY EGHOLT  891120                                           
*                                                                               
*  IN DDKORT  :  W15107D1    FIL W15107                                         
*                                                                               
*  UT DDKORT  :  W15107D2    PRINTER                                            
*                                                                               
*     DATUM      NAMN                     AVD                                   
*     ........   ....................     ..............                        
*     921106     CONNY                    30621                                 
*             :  NY PRINTERADRESS                                               
*     940519     CONNY                    57053                                 
*             :  VADIS FLAGGOR                                                  
*     951201     STEFAN ANDREASSON FRONTEC 57053                                
*             :  PUBKODER                                                       
*     981217     CONNY EGHOLT             9232                                  
*             :  3-STÄLLIG KDCATPUB BYTS TILL KDCATPUB-R                        
*--------------------------INFIL------------------------------------            
 FILE  W15107D1                                                                 
*                                                                               
 %W15107   'IN-'                                                                
*-------------------------PRINTFILER--------------------------------            
FILE W15107D2 PRINTER FB(82 82)                                                 
*                                                                               
*-------------*                                                                 
* ARBETSAREOR *                                                                 
*-------------*                                                                 
* SPAR CONTROL-ELEMENT FÖR LIST-RAD-BRYTNING                                    
 W-BRYT-GRUPP              W 2 N                                                
*                                                                               
 W-SPAR-IDCATGRP-U         W 2 N                                                
*                                                                               
 W-SPAR-IDCATAVS           W 4 N                                                
*                                                                               
 W-L-AVS                   W 5 A                                                
 W-L-AVS-RED W-L-AVS     +1  4 A                                                
 W-L-AVS-R-1 W-L-AVS-RED     1 A                                                
 W-L-AVS-R-2 W-L-AVS-RED +1  1 A                                                
 W-L-AVS-R-3 W-L-AVS-RED +2  1 A                                                
*                                                                               
 W-L-ILL-RED               W 5 A                                                
 W-L-ILL-R-1 W-L-ILL-RED     1 A                                                
 W-L-ILL-R-2 W-L-ILL-RED +1  1 A                                                
 W-L-ILL-R-3 W-L-ILL-RED +2  1 A                                                
 W-L-ILL-R-4 W-L-ILL-RED +3  1 A                                                
*                                                                               
 SPRAK-KODER  W 30 A  VALUE +                                                   
                      'D  +                                                     
                       E  +                                                     
                       F  +                                                     
                       GB +                                                     
                       I  +                                                     
                       NL +                                                     
                       P  +                                                     
                       S  +                                                     
                       SF +                                                     
                       USA'                                                     
*                                                                               
 SPRAK-KOD SPRAK-KODER 3 A, OCCURS (10) INDEX (INDX)                            
                                                                                
SPRAK  W 240 A  VALUE +                                                         
                      'TYSKA       GERMAN      +                                
                       SPANSKA     SPANISH     +                                
                       FRANSKA     FRENCH      +                                
                       ENGELSKA    ENGLISH     +                                
                       ITALIENSKA  ITALIAN     +                                
                       HOLLÄNDSKA  DUTCH       +                                
                       PORTUGISISKAPORTUGUESE  +                                
                       SVENSKA     SWEDISH     +                                
                       FINSKA      FINNISH     +                                
                       AMERIKANSKA AMERICAN    '                                
*                                                                               
 SPRAK-TEXT  SPRAK       24 A, OCCURS (10) INDEX (INDX)                         
 SPRAK-SPRAK SPRAK-TEXT  12 A, OCCURS (2)  INDEX (S-IX)                         
*                                                                               
 WL-HUV-RUB            W 62 A  VALUE +                                          
                      'LISTA AVSNITTSRUBRIKER, & ILLU.+                         
                       LIST TEXT BLOCK HEADINGS & ILL.'                         
  L-H-RUB   WL-HUV-RUB   31 A, OCCURS (2) INDEX (S-IX)                          
*                                                                               
 WL-DATUM              W 12 A  VALUE 'DATUM: DATE:'                             
  L-DATUM   WL-DATUM      6 A, OCCURS (2) INDEX (S-IX)                          
*                                                                               
 WL-KATALOG            W 14 A  VALUE 'KATALOGCATALOG'                           
  L-KATALOG WL-KATALOG    7 A, OCCURS (2) INDEX (S-IX)                          
*                                                                               
 WL-GRUPP              W 10 A  VALUE 'GRUPPGROUP'                               
  L-GRUPP   WL-GRUPP      5 A, OCCURS (2) INDEX (S-IX)                          
*                                                                               
 WL-HGRP               W  8 A  VALUE 'HGRPMGRP'                                 
  L-HGRP    WL-HGRP       4 A, OCCURS (2) INDEX (S-IX)                          
*                                                                               
 WL-UGRP               W  8 A  VALUE 'UGRPSUBG'                                 
  L-UGRP    WL-UGRP       4 A, OCCURS (2) INDEX (S-IX)                          
*                                                                               
 WL-AVSN               W 10 A  VALUE ' AVSNT-BLK'                               
  L-AVSN    WL-AVSN       5 A, OCCURS (2) INDEX (S-IX)                          
*                                                                               
 WL-RUBRIK             W 24 A  VALUE 'RUBRIKTEXT  +                             
                                      HEADING TEXT'                             
  L-RUBRIK  WL-RUBRIK    12 A, OCCURS (2) INDEX (S-IX)                          
*                                                                               
 WL-RADER              W 16 A  VALUE 'RADER>19LINES>19'                         
  L-RADER   WL-RADER      8 A, OCCURS (2) INDEX (S-IX)                          
*                                                                               
 WL-PUB                W  6 A  VALUE 'PUBPUB'                                   
  L-PUB     WL-PUB        3 A, OCCURS (2) INDEX (S-IX)                          
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
*--------------------COPY-TEXT--------------------------------------            
 %WTXTAREA                                                                      
*                                                                               
*--------------------LIST-POST--------------------------------------            
 LIST-IDCATNR       W  5 N     MASK (A 'Z9999')                                 
 LIST-IDCATGRP-FRAN W  2 N     MASK (B '99')                                    
 LIST-IDCATGRP-TILL W  2 N     MASK  B                                          
 LIST-HGRP          W  3 N     MASK (C 'ZZZ')                                   
 LIST-UGRP          W  3 N     MASK  C                                          
 LIST-IDCATAVS      W  4 A                                                      
 LIST-IDILLU        W  5 A                                                      
 LIST-BERUBTXT      W 25 A                                                      
 LIST-SPRAK         W 12 A                                                      
 LIST-KDCATPUB-R    W  3 A                                                      
                                                                                
*    -- CHECKED BY WY2000                                                       
*                                                                               
*---------------------------------------------*                                 
*                      JOB                    *                                 
*---------------------------------------------*                                 
JOB INPUT W15107D1                                                              
*                                                                               
  IF INDX GT 10                                                                 
  ELSE                                                                          
     IF IN-IDSKYLT-H = 'S  '                                                    
        S-IX = 1                                                                
     ELSE                                                                       
*       IN-IDSKYLT-H = 'GB '                                                    
        S-IX = 2                                                                
     END-IF                                                                     
                                                                                
     INDX = 1                                                                   
     DO WHILE INDX < 11                                                         
        IF IN-IDSKYLT = SPRAK-KOD(INDX)                                         
           LIST-SPRAK = SPRAK-SPRAK(INDX, S-IX)                                 
           INDX = 10                                                            
        END-IF                                                                  
        INDX = INDX + 1                                                         
     END-DO                                                                     
     LIST-IDCATNR = IN-IDCATNR                                                  
     LIST-IDCATGRP-FRAN = IN-IDCATGRP-FRAN                                      
     LIST-IDCATGRP-TILL = IN-IDCATGRP-TILL                                      
     LIST-KDCATPUB-R = IN-KDCATPUB-R                                            
  END-IF                                                                        
*                                                                               
  IF IN-BERUBTXT NE ' '                                                         
     RTXT-TETEXTTR = IN-BERUBTXT                                                
     RTXT-KDTEXTTR = 'V'                                                        
     CALL WTXTTR USING RTXT-WTXTAREA                                            
     LIST-BERUBTXT = RTXT-TETEXTTR                                              
  ELSE                                                                          
     LIST-BERUBTXT = IN-BERUBTXT                                                
  END-IF                                                                        
*                                                                               
*********************************************************                       
* REDIGERA IDCATGRP-H & IDCATGRP-U                      *                       
*********************************************************                       
  IF IN-IDLISTA = '001'                                                         
     IF IN-IDCATGRP-H EQ W-BRYT-GRUPP                                           
        LIST-HGRP = 0                                                           
     ELSE                                                                       
        W-BRYT-GRUPP = IN-IDCATGRP-H                                            
        LIST-HGRP    = IN-IDCATGRP-H                                            
     END-IF                                                                     
     IF IN-IDCATGRP-U EQ W-SPAR-IDCATGRP-U                                      
        LIST-UGRP    = 0                                                        
     ELSE                                                                       
        LIST-UGRP    = IN-IDCATGRP-U                                            
     END-IF                                                                     
  ELSE                                                                          
**   IN-IDLISTA ÄR '002'                                                        
     IF IN-IDCATGRP-U EQ W-BRYT-GRUPP                                           
        LIST-UGRP = 0                                                           
     ELSE                                                                       
        W-BRYT-GRUPP = IN-IDCATGRP-U                                            
        LIST-UGRP    = IN-IDCATGRP-U                                            
     END-IF                                                                     
     LIST-HGRP  = 0                                                             
  END-IF                                                                        
*********************************************************                       
* REDIGERA MULTIPEL FÖREKOMST AV IDCATAVS               *                       
*********************************************************                       
  W-L-AVS = IN-IDCATAVS                                                         
  IF W-L-AVS-R-1 EQ '0'                                                         
     W-L-AVS-R-1 = ' '                                                          
     IF W-L-AVS-R-2 EQ '0'                                                      
        W-L-AVS-R-2 = ' '                                                       
        IF W-L-AVS-R-3 EQ '0'                                                   
           W-L-AVS-R-3 = ' '                                                    
        END-IF                                                                  
     END-IF                                                                     
  END-IF                                                                        
  LIST-IDCATAVS = W-L-AVS-RED                                                   
*                                                                               
  IF IN-IDLISTA EQ '001'                                                        
     IF IN-IDCATGRP-U EQ W-SPAR-IDCATGRP-U                                      
        IF IN-IDCATAVS GT 0                                                     
           IF IN-IDCATAVS EQ W-SPAR-IDCATAVS                                    
              LIST-IDCATAVS EQ '    '                                           
           END-IF                                                               
        END-IF                                                                  
     END-IF                                                                     
  ELSE                                                                          
**   IN-IDLISTA  ÄR  '002'                                                      
     IF IN-IDCATGRP-U EQ W-SPAR-IDCATGRP-U                                      
        IF IN-IDCATAVS EQ W-SPAR-IDCATAVS                                       
           LIST-IDCATAVS = '    '                                               
        END-IF                                                                  
     END-IF                                                                     
  END-IF                                                                        
*                                                                               
  W-SPAR-IDCATGRP-U = IN-IDCATGRP-U                                             
  W-SPAR-IDCATAVS = IN-IDCATAVS                                                 
*********************************************************                       
* REDIGERA IDILLU  (INLEDANDE NOLLOR I ALFA-FÄLT)       *                       
*********************************************************                       
  IF IN-IDILLU = -1                                                             
     LIST-IDILLU = '-ERR-'                                                      
  ELSE                                                                          
     IF LIST-IDCATAVS EQ '    '                                                 
        LIST-IDILLU = '     '                                                   
     ELSE                                                                       
        W-L-ILL-RED = IN-IDILLU                                                 
        IF W-L-ILL-R-1 EQ '0'                                                   
           W-L-ILL-R-1 =  ' '                                                   
           IF W-L-ILL-R-2 EQ '0'                                                
              W-L-ILL-R-2 =  ' '                                                
              IF W-L-ILL-R-3 EQ '0'                                             
                 W-L-ILL-R-3 =  ' '                                             
                 IF W-L-ILL-R-4 EQ '0'                                          
                    W-L-ILL-R-4 =  ' '                                          
                 END-IF                                                         
              END-IF                                                            
           END-IF                                                               
        END-IF                                                                  
        LIST-IDILLU = W-L-ILL-RED                                               
     END-IF                                                                     
  END-IF                                                                        
*                                                                               
  IF IN-KDPRTVAL = 'A'                                                          
     PRINT RAPPORT01                                                            
  END-IF                                                                        
*---------------------------------------------*                                 
* RAPPORT 01                                  *                                 
* LISTA TILL PRINTER MED KDPRTVAL = A         *                                 
*---------------------------------------------*                                 
  REPORT RAPPORT01  PRINTER W15107D2  +                                         
                    LINESIZE 71     +                                           
                    PAGESIZE 65     +                                           
                    NOADJUST  NOHEADING NODATE +                                
                    TITLESKIP 1                                                 
                                                                                
         CONTROL FINAL        NOPRINT +                                         
                 W-BRYT-GRUPP NOPRINT                                           
                                                                                
    TITLE 1 COL   2 'W15107-'    +                                              
            COL   9 IN-IDLISTA +                                                
            COL  15 L-H-RUB(S-IX)                                               
*                                                                               
    TITLE 2 COL  57 L-DATUM(S-IX) +                                             
            COL  64 SYSDATE                                                     
    TITLE 3 COL  61 'T:'         +                                              
            COL  64 SYSTIME                                                     
*                                                                               
    TITLE 4 COL   2 L-KATALOG(S-IX) +                                           
            COL   9 LIST-IDCATNR +                                              
            COL  16 IN-BEEMBLEM +                                               
            COL  24 L-GRUPP(S-IX) +                                             
            COL  30 LIST-IDCATGRP-FRAN +                                        
            COL  34 '-' +                                                       
            COL  35 LIST-IDCATGRP-TILL +                                        
            COL  44 LIST-SPRAK   +                                              
            COL  56 'D'  +                                                      
            COL  59 'V'  +                                                      
            COL  66 ' '                                                         
*                                                                               
    TITLE 5 COL  24 L-PUB(S-IX) +                                               
            COL  29 LIST-KDCATPUB-R +                                           
            COL  54 'N'          +                                              
            COL  56 'I'          +                                              
            COL  59 'A'                                                         
*                                                                               
    TITLE 6 COL   2 L-HGRP(S-IX) +                                              
            COL   7 L-UGRP(S-IX) +                                              
            COL  12 L-AVSN(S-IX) +                                              
            COL  18 L-RUBRIK(S-IX) +                                            
            COL  39 L-RADER(S-IX) +                                             
            COL  49 'ILLU' +                                                    
            COL  54 'Y'    +                                                    
            COL  56 'G'    +                                                    
            COL  59 'D'    +                                                    
            COL  61 'Ä'    +                                                    
            COL  63 'PUBF' +                                                    
            COL  68 'PUBT'                                                      
*                                                                               
    LINE  1 COL   3 LIST-HGRP +                                                 
            COL   8 LIST-UGRP +                                                 
            COL  13 LIST-IDCATAVS +                                             
            COL  18 LIST-BERUBTXT +                                             
            COL  45 IN-RAD-FINNS +                                              
            COL  48 LIST-IDILLU +                                               
            COL  54 IN-NYILLU +                                                 
            COL  56 IN-DIGILL +                                                 
            COL  59 IN-FLAVSTVAD +                                              
            COL  61 IN-FLAVSUST +                                               
            COL  63 IN-KDCATPUB-R-FOM +                                         
            COL  68 IN-KDCATPUB-R-TOM                                           
BEFORE-BREAK.                                                                   
PROC                                                                            
     DISPLAY COL 04 '---------------'                  +                        
             COL 18 '--------------------------------' +                        
             COL 50 '----------------------'                                    
END-PROC                                                                        
